# Resume Output Directory

This directory is auto-populated by the Resume Builder pipeline.
Each subdirectory contains a tailored resume for a specific company:

```
<Role>_<Company>_<Date>/
├── resume.pdf       # The compiled 1-page PDF
├── resume.tex       # Generated LaTeX source
├── metadata.yaml    # Build metadata (role, company, keywords)
└── ats_score.yaml   # 3-engine ATS score breakdown
```

To regenerate, run a build from the Web UI or CLI.
